sca-usd-export 0.1.0

This add-on adapts the OpenUSD export implementation originally developed
under extensions/usd_export/ in the SimpleCADAPI project:
https://github.com/PhySpace/SimpleCADAPI

SimpleCADAPI is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The upstream license text is retained in LICENSE. This distribution adds
independent Python packaging, SCA add-on metadata, isolated runtime setup,
Windows argument transport, and add-on usage documentation.

Only the export extension implementation is reused. No SimpleCADAPI core
source code is copied or vendored into this repository. SimpleCADAPI and
its geometry kernel are runtime dependencies installed into the add-on's
separate environment; they retain their own notices and licenses.
The separately installed cadquery-ocp dependency is pinned to 7.9.3.1 to
match the original exporter's kernel baseline; it is not bundled here.

OpenUSD and other third-party dependencies retain their respective
licenses and notices. This add-on does not include or validate Isaac Sim.

The maintained 0.1.6rc1 candidate adds package-declared rigid capsule/D6 chains,
SI stage-unit conversion and independent reopened-chain checks. These local
changes do not modify upstream licensing or include a physics solver.
